enced after the `llm` child because `_commands`\nconsumes llm's contracts; sequenced before `_engine` because it has the smaller residue and no\nexternal collision.\n\n## Scope\nPromote `rebar._commands.*` into tier 1 (`disallow_untyped_defs`) in pyproject.toml and pin it in\n`_RATCHET_BASELINE`. Residue measured on main @ ea6ee67e6a: 146 untyped defs, explicit Any count\nrecorded as 'large' and to be measured at claim time.\n\n## Constraints (inherited from the epic)\n- No `cast()`, no `: Any` / `-> Any` to satisfy the ratchet.\n- Tier 2 is a separate later step.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `mypy src/rebar/_commands --disallow-untyped-defs` is clean with NO new `: Any` / `-> Any`.\n- [ ] `rebar._commands.*` is in the tier-1 override and pinned in `_RATCHET_BASELINE`.\n- [ ] No file exceeds the 800 LOC cap; complexity ratchet shows no new/increased entries.\n- [ ] Behaviour unchanged: existing tests pass unmodified.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","2cdd-e9d3-e42b-4709"],["parent","003c-2dd2-203a-4725"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"003c-2dd2-203a-4725","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"201d-64e2-537c-4df6","ticket_type":"story","title":"Promote rebar._commands.* into the mypy tier-1 typing ratchet (146 untyped defs)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["769636ae-fe8e-4695-8ddf-0c10aa1ff33b","aa95974a-6294-4a0a-bde5-c69f3160e48a"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787178581278568001,"uuid":"a49a7df5-7feb-4630-947c-69069aa83648"}